  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "寒--人半暝ê羊油米糕"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>思&nbsp; &nbsp; 菊</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮兜是一个大家族，頭喙tsiok濟，大大細細beh 25个人，tī hit个物資欠缺ê年代，細漢時逐頓飯khann lóng是三份一ê白米、三份二ê番薯，koh是曝ta ê番薯乾。雖bóng講阮兜有四个人tī公家機關kap學校leh上班，iáu-m̄-koh濟人食用，所致huānn家ê大伯姑不將一sián五厘儉儉仔用，bē用得烏白拍損！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大姆、二姆ài輪火khau煮食，阮阿母是老師所以無kap阿姆in輪煮食。雖bóng ài儉，iáu-m̄-koh mā三不五時ài補--一-下，所以寒--人阿媽ē huan咐煮食ê阿姆，準備一份阮逐个人lóng tsiok期待--ê——羊油米糕！雖bóng阮m̄知影佗一工tsiah有thang食，因為m̄是逐工有，看阿媽按怎hua̍t-lo̍h，阿姆tsiah ē去tshuân食材。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit份米糕是用tsu̍t米煮--ê，日--時ài先kā tsu̍t米浸hōo軟，tsiah用羊油炒薑母khiàn芳，tsit時tsu̍t米落鼎做伙炒，bái-bái火kā tsu̍t米炒熟tsiah算完成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī冷冷koh寒ê暗暝，睏到半暝hōo大人叫起來食hit碗燒、芳koh有滋味ê米糕，一人一碗phâng去房間食，心肝底感覺tsiok燒lō。囡仔時kan-na感覺tsiânn芳、tsiânn好食，暗時食bē完ê米糕兩碗sio-khap，第二工透早拜託阿姆煎hōo燒，hit款滋味iáu koh-khah芳。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tse是阮兜寒--人半暝仔ê米糕，hōo阮不時就tsiok siàu念，iáu-m̄-koh ē-hiáu炒tsit味米糕ê序大lóng做仙--去--ah。阮tsit-má所siàu念ê滋味，除了hit-lō芳iáu有序大對厝內所有人ê關懷kap疼thàng。以早蹛tī正身護龍內底ê兄弟姊妹仔，tsit-má lín lóng好--無？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhNrj-LEuJBjTrQJp0JfT1p42FyoXVpipUENA2CApAQ3xEROnVzstOtC3EATPv2r3tVbP3Xe2UjJA9BBQ5EM1wYYbuHNwAtCgQmKC9sQrwCOobYmn_Z5xpc9h8ZS656kEUReHm7lzR8RGIYDitvBRVUpey4ILzY7xA2x_He8OnjA_G_793w7IL-6k4vTFIu/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhNrj-LEuJBjTrQJp0JfT1p42FyoXVpipUENA2CApAQ3xEROnVzstOtC3EATPv2r3tVbP3Xe2UjJA9BBQ5EM1wYYbuHNwAtCgQmKC9sQrwCOobYmn_Z5xpc9h8ZS656kEUReHm7lzR8RGIYDitvBRVUpey4ILzY7xA2x_He8OnjA_G_793w7IL-6k4vTFIu/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1358%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEivZ-nm2Pl2m8Bm4RQYGCk2iLNZdi_j_hRcL31tDrNb_KOw5XS3fzpSykRat-a0QYIahTS6XofnuLM6M_94VRMA6Js5TYMGD4YlYyYGT7Aj-QJzHJ_QCNPDACGCHNsTx5a078_PWU8RFhFHpGFLKgLVKvvhUWXXfnlnnQrWF5LCr6rDiSv4i4S1GqW4Dnfu/s1424/358%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEivZ-nm2Pl2m8Bm4RQYGCk2iLNZdi_j_hRcL31tDrNb_KOw5XS3fzpSykRat-a0QYIahTS6XofnuLM6M_94VRMA6Js5TYMGD4YlYyYGT7Aj-QJzHJ_QCNPDACGCHNsTx5a078_PWU8RFhFHpGFLKgLVKvvhUWXXfnlnnQrWF5LCr6rDiSv4i4S1GqW4Dnfu/w450-h640/358%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clea